  "question": {
    "text": "A spherical ball of density <math> <mrow> <mtext>ρ</mtext> </mrow> </math> and radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>003</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is dropped into a tube containing a viscous fluid, filled up to the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> mark as shown in the figure. Viscosity of the fluid =<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>260</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and its density <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>ρ</mtext> <mtext>L</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>ρ</mtext><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1260</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Assume the ball reaches a terminal speed by the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> mark. Find the time taken by the ball to traverse the distance between the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> mark. [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> = acceleration due to gravity = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><sup>​​</sup>&nbsp;]<br />\r<u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/10780-1.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 201px;\" /></strong></u>",
